LOCUS       example_vRNA_bc_H3      1953 bp    ss-RNA  linear   SYN 15-SEP-2026
DEFINITION  Example barcoded influenza vRNA segment carrying the H3 HA from
            A/Darwin/1454/2025 with the barcode of TTCCCAGTACTTCTAG, presented
            in mRNA sense. Runs from the 3' NCR (U12) through the 5' NCR (U13),
            inclusive. Carries a WSN signal peptide, a consensus H3 endodomain,
            a recoded WSN C-terminal domain, a 16-nucleotide barcode, an
            Illumina Read1 sequence, and a duplicated WSN packaging signal.
ACCESSION   .
VERSION     .
KEYWORDS    .
SOURCE      synthetic DNA construct
  ORGANISM  synthetic DNA construct
            .
